WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.634
It's the moment you've been waiting for
Invercargill.

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:03.530
 The voting in the by-election is open!

00:00:04.896 --> 00:00:08.202
Your papers will be arriving by mail from today

00:00:08.202 --> 00:00:10.144
and you can drop them in at any post box,

00:00:10.144 --> 00:00:11.820
The Bluff Service Centre,

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:13.273
the city library

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:15.307
or the Civic Administration Building.

00:00:15.307 --> 00:00:16.560
If you need to do a special vote because

00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:19.520
you're on the unpublished role or your voting papers don't arrive

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.720
or you make a mistake you can come in and see us

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:26.720
at the Bluff Service Centre or the CAB on Esk street.

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.000
Voting closes at 12 pm on Tuesday 17 February.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.520
so get ticking Invercargill. Every vote will count.

